            "review_title": "Review at Chula Corner",
            "review_text": "Dreamerisme\n1 contribution\n0\nNew great place in Da Nang\nMay 2024 • Couples\nNew great place in Da Nang. I love the atmosphere, drinks and people here. Not too much crowed and good music too. Chilling light makes photos very romantic.\nI did have a memorable anniversary with my husband here.\nInsider tip:\nYou should come when you visit Da Nang, just in the center of the city.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 30, 2024",
